                "text": "On Friday, I presented $350,000 from the Fiscal Year 2023 Community Project Funding process to Saint Joseph Berea Hospital. \n\nThis funding will be used to purchase a cardiac focused nuclear medicine camera with multiple components of advanced technology. This funding is vital to enhancing healthcare accessibility and quality in Central Kentucky, ensuring that Saint Joseph Berea remains at the forefront of medical excellence and patient care.",
