                "text": "June is Alzheimer's and Brain Awareness Month, a time to focus on the millions of families affected by these diseases. I'm proud to support the NAPA Reauthorization Act and the BOLD Act. These crucial bills enhance care, support families, and bolster public health efforts to combat Alzheimer\u2019s. Together, we can work towards a future free from these devastating illnesses.",
