                "text": "Today, I had the opportunity to visit Sterling Health Solutions with the Kentucky Primary Care Association, State Rep. David Hale, and State Senator Greg Elkins. Sterling Health is doing tremendous work ensuring that our communities have access to the quality care they deserve. It's efforts like these that make a real difference in the lives of Kentuckians, and I\u2019m proud to support their mission.",
