                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "In honor of National Stillbirth Prevention Day today, I am co-sponsoring the SHINE for Autumn Act. Stillbirths remain one of least understood and most underfunded public health issues that our nation\u2019s mothers face. This legislation will enhance research, education, and awareness for stillbirths and turn the tide on these unforgotten tragedies.",
