                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I continue to hear concerns from Veterans in my district regarding the disastrous complications they're having with Compensation and Pension exams. These exams are critical in providing medical evidence for veteran's benefits claims and they must be conducted properly. \n\nToday I spoke with leadership at both the Veterans Benefits Administration Louisville Regional office as well as the VA Central office to address these concerns. \n\nI will always advocate for the veterans in my district and honor their important service to our nation.",
