                "text": "Grateful for the opportunity to attend the Kentucky Hospital Association\u2019s 2024 Health Policy Conference this morning. Healthcare providers play an essential role in ensuring access to high-quality, affordable care across our communities. I appreciated the opportunity to update KHA on my efforts in Washington, and I remain committed to supporting their policy goals to strengthen medical resources for the Commonwealth.",
